{
  "schema": "fablereborn.raid-node",
  "version": 1,
  "name": "Dragon's Hoard Heist",
  "description": "Stealth heist through three rooms. Each vote adds Noise; greedy options add Dragon Gold, and a tie adds 4 Noise. Noise 5 or lower escapes cleanly, 6-9 is a 50/50 roll and 10+ wakes the dragon. Stealing her egg is the loudest option. If she wakes while you hold it, the party can return it and lose all gold. Otherwise they flee for 5 rounds from fire that hits everyone. Dive for Cover blocks the flames; Toss Stolen Gold stuns her for two rounds. Next: every outcome.",
  "entry": "heist_intro",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "heist_intro",
      "kind": "scene",
      "title": "The Dragon's Hoard",
      "text": "Somewhere below, something enormous is snoring. The cavern floor is a sea of gold.\n\nEvery choice makes **noise**. Greed makes more. Stay quiet and you slip out rich; make too much noise and the dragon wakes. Stolen **Dragon Gold** can be tossed to distract her in battle.",
      "next": "coin_sea",
      "rules": []
    },
    {
      "id": "coin_sea",
      "kind": "choice",
      "title": "The Coin Sea",
      "text": "A river of coins between you and the inner chamber. Every step clinks.",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "edge",
          "label": "Tiptoe along the cave wall",
          "next": "coin_sea_edge"
        },
        {
          "id": "greedy",
          "label": "Fill our pockets as we wade through",
          "next": "coin_sea_greedy"
        }
